<title>USA: PHLX to trade five new equity options from July 14.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade five new equity options from July 14.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange will list options on five stocks on July 14, the exchange said Thursday.</p>
<p>The stocks include Carpenter Technology Corp, Commerce Bancorp Inc, One Valley Bancorp Inc, ServiceMaster LP and Suiza Foods Corp.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols and the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits in number of contracts and specialist unit.  </p>
<p>    Strikes	Expir	 Limits   Specialist</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    40, 45, 50   Aug, Sep,   4,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>		     Dec, Mar		 Group</p>
<p>    35, 40, 45   Aug, Sep,   4,500    Spear, Leeds &amp;</p>
<p>		     Dec, Mar		 Kellogg</p>
<p>    35, 40, 45   Aug, Sep,   4,500    Spear, Leeds &amp;</p>
<p>		     Dec, Mar		 Kellogg</p>
<p>    22-1/2, 25,  Aug, Sep,   7,500    Spear, Leeds &amp;</p>
<p>    30	     Oct, Jan		 Kellogg</p>
<p>    35, 40, 45   Aug, Sep,   4,500    Spear, Leeds &amp;</p>
<p>		     Dec, Mar		 Kellogg</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
